        "blocks": [
         {
          "content_type": "block",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
           "content": "<p>Bonjour {{ first_name }},</p>",
           "display_options": {},
           "styles": {
            "block_padding_bottom": 0,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
            "block_padding_right": 0,
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "inner_padding_bottom": 9,
            "inner_padding_left": 18,
            "inner_padding_right": 18,
            "inner_padding_top": 9,
            "mobile_stretch_content": false,
            "text_table_layout": "fixed"
           }
          },
          "id": "fa2333d14fa34c1e9e56b3e58ce4ec1c",
          "data_id": "0c2fb55a1b524fe7a532b4ff86a19cc7"
         },
         {
          "content_type": "block",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
           "content": "<p>Une semaine jour pour jour depuis l'ouverture de la Grande Prévente automnale. La poussière est retombée, on peut souffler un peu, et voici des nouvelles.</p><p>C'est <strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">une des meilleures préventes d'automne de notre histoire</strong>. Merci, sincèrement.</p><p>Ce que ça change, concrètement: la production part de ces commandes-là. C'est ce qui nous permet de commander les bonnes quantités de tissu, de fil et d'asclépiade au lieu de deviner, et c'est exactement pour ça que la prévente existe.</p>",
           "display_options": {},
           "styles": {
            "block_padding_bottom": 0,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
            "block_padding_right": 0,
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "inner_padding_bottom": 9,
            "inner_padding_left": 18,
            "inner_padding_right": 18,
            "inner_padding_top": 9,
            "mobile_stretch_content": false,
            "text_table_layout": "fixed"
           }
          },
          "id": "75a47784a2a74626bdc0020f782389bc",
          "data_id": "2fc208dbb6104b4ea65d5fab86e5192f"
         },
         {
          "content_type": "block",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
           "content": "<h3 style=\"font-style: normal; text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0px; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: none; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Geneva, Arial; font-size: 24px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les produits les plus populaires</strong></h3><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/gants-magiques-asclepiade\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les gants magiques doublés en asclépiade</strong></span></a>, premiers et de loin.</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/boite-essai-soins-huile-asclepiade\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">La boîte d'essai des soins à l'huile&nbsp;d'asclépiade</strong></span></a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/pince-a-cheveux-plastique-recycle-asclepiade\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les pinces à cheveux Unique Plastique x Lasclay</strong></span></a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/t-shirt-coton-brode-monarque-asclepiade\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les t-shirts brodés</strong></span></a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/thermal-insoles\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les semelles isolantes</strong></span></a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://lasclay.com/products/barre-savon-huile-asclepiade\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(212, 173, 103);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(212, 173, 103); font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Les barres de savon à l'huile d'asclépiade</strong></span></a></p></li></ul>",
           "display_options": {},
           "styles": {
            "block_padding_bottom": 0,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
            "block_padding_right": 0,
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "inner_padding_bottom": 9,
